  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed timber deck, by reason of its siting and excessive height, results in harmful overlooking over the rear garden and adjacent ground floor rear and flank habitable room windows of No. 173 Chase Road, severely restricting the level of privacy afforded to occupants of this neighbouring property, compromising their overall standards of residential amenity. The proposal would therefore be contrary to Policies D3 of the London Plan (2021), CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), DMD 8 of the Development Management Document (2014), as well as the aims and intentions outlined within the NPPF (2024)."
